#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:16 a3b7e703edde4abf938680f8cf268e60
msgid "Hard limiter to prevent audio clipping and distortion."
msgstr "硬限制器，用于限制峰值电平。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:21 b40b69ef39074ef885a81494d96f0922
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:23 10cec4f1266d42bda8611d7ac7dd8182
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter is a brick-wall limiter that prevents the audio signal from exceeding "
"a specified ceiling level. It ensures that the output never goes above the threshold, effectively"
" preventing clipping and distortion that can occur when signals exceed 0 dBFS."
msgstr "**FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter**    用于阻止信号峰值超过指定上限。它常放在总线效果链后段，用于保护输出、抑制突发峰值或给某个总线做简单的安全限制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:25 066e35c754d04fbe9ab867ad24e45197
msgid ""
"Unlike a compressor which gradually reduces gain, a hard limiter applies instantaneous limiting "
"to peaks, making it ideal for final output protection and maximizing loudness without distortion."
msgstr "硬限幅器会立即限制信号峰值，适合保护最终输出，并在限制峰值的同时提高响度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:27 dbb2251f0bf549e49767565fb15aae35
msgid ""
"The limiter can also apply pre-gain to boost the signal before limiting, allowing you to maximize"
" perceived loudness while staying within safe levels."
msgstr "支持在限幅前增加预增益，以在控制峰值的同时提高感知响度。"

