msgid ""
"The maximum output level in decibels (dB). Range: -12.0 dB to 0.0 dB. Default: -0.3 dB. The "
"signal will never exceed this level. Setting this slightly below 0 dB (e.g., -0.3 dB) provides "
"safety headroom to prevent inter-sample peaks from clipping."
msgstr "输出峰值上限"

