msgid ""
"The gain applied to the signal before limiting, in decibels (dB). Range: -30 dB to +30 dB. "
"Default: 0 dB. Use positive values to boost quiet signals before limiting, which can increase "
"perceived loudness. The limiting stage ensures the final output never exceeds the ceiling "
"regardless of pre-gain."
msgstr "限制前增益"

