msgid ""
"The release time in seconds. Range: 0.001 to 1.0 seconds. Default: 0.1 seconds. This controls how"
" quickly the limiter stops reducing gain after the signal drops below the ceiling. Longer release"
" times produce smoother results but may reduce transients; shorter times are more transparent but"
" may cause pumping."
msgstr "释放时间"

